# Force LF line endings on Linux-runtime artifacts so Windows clones
# with core.autocrlf=true don't break scripts deployed to the POC box.
# Mirrors what the wizard branch (feat/setup-wizard-walkthrough) does
# — keep both branches consistent.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
